---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Fractional Executive Assistant for CEOs">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>The senior executive support your calendar has been begging for.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Servare Opus embeds experienced executive assistants with a handful of CEOs and founders at a time — so you get the coverage of a full-time EA without the full-time cost or the year-long search.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="/booking" class="btn">Book a Discovery Call</a>
        <a href="/services" class="btn-outline">See What's Included</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Built for founders and CEOs who outgrew their inbox</h2>
        <p>You didn't start a company to spend six hours a week on scheduling. We take the operational weight off your plate so you can spend your time on the decisions only you can make.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="pillar-num">01</div>
          <h3>Calendar &amp; Inbox Command</h3>
          <p>Ruthless prioritization of your calendar and inbox, so every hour on it earns its place.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="pillar-num">02</div>
          <h3>Travel &amp; Logistics</h3>
          <p>End-to-end trip planning, meeting prep, and the small logistics that quietly eat a founder's week.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="pillar-num">03</div>
          <h3>Board &amp; Investor Ops</h3>
          <p>Board deck coordination, investor updates, and follow-ups handled with the discretion the room requires.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Why a shared, fractional EA works</h2>
        <p>Most CEOs don't need 40 hours a week of support — they need 10 to 20 hours of the right support, delivered by someone senior enough to run without hand-holding. We built Servare Opus around that reality: each EA works with a small, deliberately matched roster of CEOs, so you get seasoned judgment at a fraction of a full-time salary.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="actions" style="justify-content:center; display:flex;">
        <a href="/about" class="btn-outline" style="color:var(--ink) !important; border-color:var(--ink);">Learn How We Work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
